## Restore Area

Review DESIGN.md for the exact restore endpoint and semantics.

Conceptually:

Restore request
    ↓
Find DELETED Area in Workspace
    ↓
Compare expectedVersion
    ↓
Atomic conditional mutation
    ↓
status = ACTIVE
currentVersion = currentVersion + 1
    ↓
Insert AreaVersion
    changeType = RESTORED
    ↓
COMMIT

Example:

Area:
status = DELETED
currentVersion = 5

RESTORE expectedVersion=5

Expected:

status = ACTIVE
currentVersion = 6
AreaVersion(version=6, changeType=RESTORED)

After restore, the Area must again appear in normal viewport queries.

