## AreaVersion Snapshots

Every successful DELETE and RESTORE must append an AreaVersion.

For DELETE:

AreaVersion
    version = previousVersion + 1
    changeType = DELETED
    name = current Area name
    geometry = current Area geometry
    areaKm2 = current Area area
    changedBy = prototype development user

For RESTORE:

AreaVersion
    version = previousVersion + 1
    changeType = RESTORED
    name = restored Area name
    geometry = restored Area geometry
    areaKm2 = restored Area area
    changedBy = prototype development user

Use exact existing field names from the repository.

AreaVersion remains append-only.

Do not mutate previous versions.

