## Workspace Boundary

Delete and restore must enforce the Workspace boundary.

For an Area belonging to Workspace A:

DELETE /workspaces/B/areas/{areaId}
RESTORE /workspaces/B/areas/{areaId}/restore

must not expose that the Area exists in another Workspace.

Use the same boundary semantics established in Task 04.

Do not implement user authorization yet.

