## Frontend Conflict Handling

DELETE and RESTORE can also conflict with another mutation.

If the backend returns VERSION_CONFLICT:

- do not silently retry;
- do not overwrite newer state;
- inform the user;
- reload authoritative state where possible.

Reuse the Task 04 conflict handling approach rather than creating an
unrelated mechanism.

