## Repository Layer

Reuse the Task 04 atomic conditional mutation approach.

Propose the minimum repository operations for:

- conditional soft delete;
- conditional restore.

Do not load an Area, compare the version in Java, and then issue an
unconditional UPDATE.

The version/state condition must participate in the database mutation.

