## Transactions

Each successful mutation must be atomic.

DELETE:

BEGIN
  conditional soft delete
  insert DELETED AreaVersion
COMMIT

RESTORE:

BEGIN
  conditional restore
  insert RESTORED AreaVersion
COMMIT

If AreaVersion persistence fails, the Area mutation must roll back.

Do not split these operations across transactions.

